.SS "\fBAnimated\fP clearAnimationHelpers ()"

.PP
Retire all helpers on this object\&. Only this owner's registrations are removed; a retained helper may be registered again\&. Safe inside a callback: removed helpers do not run again on this step, and the currently executing callback remains alive until it returns\&.

.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The original owner object, for chaining\&. 
.RE
.PP
